  "question": "Does the National Library of China public website expose a reproducible anonymous Wenjin Search contract that can lawfully query the exact 2011 《赵万里文集》第1卷 / ISBN 9787501346653 and potentially recover p.197 without guessing endpoints or parameters?",
  "answer": "The National Library of China public homepage and resource-search page are anonymously reachable and directly source-emit the Wenjin destination http://find.nlc.cn/search/doSearch. This closes the route identity as first-party rather than guessed. However neither reviewed NLC page emits an HTML form or a named query parameter: the search field is a JavaScript-controlled input without a name attribute. The Wenjin root https://find.nlc.cn/ times out from the controlling runner, and the exact source-emitted route http://find.nlc.cn/search/doSearch returns HTTP 500 when requested as emitted with no invented parameters. Therefore no calibrated anonymous search contract is currently available, no title/ISBN query was submitted, and no zero-result or target-absence conclusion is authorized. Direct 2011 p.197 remains NOT_REVIEWED.",
